    # At year k (1 to N), alien k becomes an adult.
    # Every adult who has >= 1 stone gives 1 stone to alien k.
    # This means alien k's stones increase by the count of adults with >= 1 stone.
    # Simultaneously, if an adult had >= 1 stone and gave one away, 
    # their stone count decreases by 1.
    
